X-Bundle-Info: Fixed the Ignore Date Column filter so that it is only applied to source members of the iSphere compare editor.
X-Beta-Version: 6.2.0.b004
X-Beta-Update-Library: true
X-Beta-Update-Library-Info: New 'Synchronize Stream Files' library services. Fix compare filter of iSphere member compare. CVTSPLF accepts spooled file numbers greater than 9999.
X-Beta-Info: Added option 'iSphere Synchronize Stream Files' editor.\nFixed 'Unsupported encoding when reading file.' when opening a spooled file with an unsupported workspace encoding; such as 'COMPAT' in RDi 9.9.\nFixed 'Could not create stream file for spooled file on host.' for spooled file numbers greater than 9999.
